    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep and rewarding but still easy for new players to pick up, this fun and wacky CCG features a tactical combat board! Placing and positioning units in strategic locations adds complexity to your game-plan. Take defensive positions to protect your castle, engage in a reckless all-out assault, or complete unique map objectives to get a leg up on your opponent. Build unique decks from 7 different iconic factions: Vikings, Crusaders, Warlocks, Pirates, Ninjas, Druids, and Undead. Combine up to two factions at once for unique gameplay strategies!<br><br>Cards and Castles ULTIMATE is the third game in the Cards and Castles series, and offers many new gameplay options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRAFT TABLES!</strong>\u00a0True pass-around drafting in custom lobbies, with no currency gating!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DUAL-COLOR CARDS</strong>! Ultra-powerful cards that boost up specific color combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player <strong>STORY CAMPAIGN</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GRAVEYARD</strong> system! Slain or discarded units appear as ghosts behind your Castle. Resurrect the dead, and interact with dead units in unique ways with each color!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAP OBJECTIVES</strong>. Each multiplayer map has unique secondary objectives for you to claim.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GUARDIAN position and SAFE ZONE! Choose aggression, defense or safety with your positioning. Protect your Castle with any unit you choose, or protect key units from attack by placing them behind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster, more complex early game. Powerful combos and strategies become available very quickly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step on enemies with the new STOMP ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more deck restrictions on legendary cards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greatly reduced usage of RNG and random card generation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved user interface!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turbo collection speed; be free of the F2P grind, get card packs and powerful cards quickly as you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 500 cards to collect with more on the way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New wager-based ranked system with in-game leaderboards, and ELO scoring for top players.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep and rewarding but still easy for new players to pick up, this fun and wacky CCG features a tactical combat board! Placing and positioning units in strategic locations adds complexity to your game-plan. Take defensive positions to protect your castle, engage in a reckless all-out assault, or complete unique map objectives to get a leg up on your opponent. Build unique decks from 7 different iconic factions: Vikings, Crusaders, Warlocks, Pirates, Ninjas, Druids, and Undead. Combine up to two factions at once for unique gameplay strategies!<br><br>Cards and Castles ULTIMATE is the third game in the Cards and Castles series, and offers many new gameplay options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRAFT TABLES!</strong>\u00a0True pass-around drafting in custom lobbies, with no currency gating!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DUAL-COLOR CARDS</strong>! Ultra-powerful cards that boost up specific color combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player <strong>STORY CAMPAIGN</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GRAVEYARD</strong> system! Slain or discarded units appear as ghosts behind your Castle. Resurrect the dead, and interact with dead units in unique ways with each color!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAP OBJECTIVES</strong>. Each multiplayer map has unique secondary objectives for you to claim.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GUARDIAN position and SAFE ZONE! Choose aggression, defense or safety with your positioning. Protect your Castle with any unit you choose, or protect key units from attack by placing them behind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster, more complex early game. Powerful combos and strategies become available very quickly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step on enemies with the new STOMP ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more deck restrictions on legendary cards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greatly reduced usage of RNG and random card generation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved user interface!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turbo collection speed; be free of the F2P grind, get card packs and powerful cards quickly as you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 500 cards to collect with more on the way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New wager-based ranked system with in-game leaderboards, and ELO scoring for top players.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Cards come alive in a zany CCG unlike any other. Build decks, uncover crazy combos, and battle friends and rivals in TACTICAL CARD-BOARD COMBAT! Be free of the F2P grind and have fun building a vast card collection!",
